TEXT 1104 760 Left 2 !.subckt TL082_simple inp inn vp vn out\n* simple behavioral TL082: 3 MHz GBW, Avol 200k, output ~1.5 V from rails, 50 ohm out\nRin inp inn 1T\nG1 0 n1 inp inn 1m\nR1 n1 0 200Meg\nC1 n1 0 53p\nB1 n2 0 V=min(max(V(n1),V(vn)+1.5),V(vp)-1.5)\nRout n2 out 50\nRq vp vn 100k\n.ends TL082_simple
